Hi,

So I can't share my own data, and cannot find suitable open data, so I've had a go at simulating typical data for anyone who thinks they might be able to implement these models - R script attached (its crude, but it approximates the kind of data I'm trying to analyse). What I want to do is model multiple outcomes in a hierarchical structure by domain (this kind of problem comes up in psychometric data, EEG data and probably other areas). The theory is here: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3031784/ , and the model form proposed is given in equation 2 <https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3031784/#FD2> of the paper.

Thanks to Rue or others who might be able to help.

James

